    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "depth": 1,
      "text": "Récursivité",
      "slug": "récursivité"
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "block",
      "blockType": "definition",
      "titleHtml": "Fonction récursive",
      "displayLabel": "Definition 4",
      "number": "4",
      "options": {
        "numbered": true,
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed": false,
        "style": "fill"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Une fonction <em>récursive</em> est une fonction qui s'appelle elle-même.\nElle contient au minimum une condition d'arrêt et un appel récursif.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<p>Lorsqu'elle est exécutée, la fonction exécute les instructions constituant son corps puis s'appelle elle-même.\nCet appel est ajouté sur la pile d'exécution comme un appel traditionnel.\nLes appels successifs s'empilent jusqu'à ce que la condition d'arrêt soit vraie.\nLa pile est alors vidée, chaque appel retournant son résultat intermédiaire à l'appel précédent.</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "block",
      "blockType": "example",
      "displayLabel": "Example 6",
      "number": "6",
      "options": {
        "numbered": true,
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed": false,
        "style": "rule"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Observez ce que vous suggère Google lorsque vous saisissez la recherche « récursivité ».</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<p>Certains types de problèmes sont bien plus simples à implémenter de façon récursive par rapport à leur version itérative.\nC'est en particulier le cas des suites numériques définies par récurrence : le calcul du <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>-ième terme nécessite de trouver le terme général de la suite si on ne possède pas d'ordinateur.\nDans le cas contraire, il suffit d'implémenter la fonction récursive associée à la suite.</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "block",
      "blockType": "example",
      "displayLabel": "Example 7",
      "number": "7",
      "options": {
        "numbered": true,
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed": false,
        "style": "rule"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Considérons la suite réelle <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u_n)_{n \\in \\mathbb{N}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> définie par <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_0 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> et, pour tout entier <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> positif, par</p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{n+1} = \\left( 1 + \\frac{1}{n+1} \\right) u_n \\,.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span><p>L'implémentation récursive de la suite suit simplement sa définition.</p><pre class=\"language-c\"><code class=\"language-c code-highlight\"><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">float</span> <span class=\"token function\">sequence</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\t<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>n <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\t\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\">\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1.f</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.f</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token function\">sequence</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>n <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</span></code></pre>"
        }
      ]
    }
